[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":1658},["ShallowReactive",2],{"docs-page-fr-\u002Finstallation":3,"docs-nav-fr":241},{"id":4,"title":5,"body":6,"description":234,"extension":235,"meta":236,"navigation":237,"order":177,"path":238,"seo":239,"stem":12,"__hash__":240},"content_fr\u002Finstallation.md","Installation",{"type":7,"value":8,"toc":227},"minimark",[9,13,30,35,59,62,66,80,83,87,112,123,127,134,138,153,186,202,223],[10,11,5],"h1",{"id":12},"installation",[14,15,16,17,22,23,29],"p",{},"Récupère un build sur la ",[18,19,21],"a",{"href":20},"\u002Fdownload","page Télécharger"," ou sur ",[18,24,28],{"href":25,"rel":26},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest",[27],"nofollow","GitHub Releases",". SoundNinja est en développement précoce — traite les builds comme des bêtas.",[31,32,34],"h2",{"id":33},"windows","Windows",[36,37,38,50,53,56],"ul",{},[39,40,41,45,46,49],"li",{},[42,43,44],"strong",{},"Installateur (.exe)"," ou ",[42,47,48],{},"MSI (.msi)"," pour Windows 64 bits",[39,51,52],{},"Cible de la landing page : Windows 10 et plus",[39,54,55],{},"Le README de l’app mentionne aussi Windows 8 et supérieur",[39,57,58],{},"L’installateur NSIS est sombre. Choisis une langue à l’installation — SoundNinja la retient au prochain lancement.",[14,60,61],{},"Lance l’installateur, puis ouvre SoundNinja depuis le menu Démarrer.",[31,63,65],{"id":64},"macos","macOS",[36,67,68,74,77],{},[39,69,70,73],{},[42,71,72],{},".dmg universel"," pour Apple Silicon et Intel",[39,75,76],{},"Cible de la landing page : macOS 10.14 et plus",[39,78,79],{},"Le README de l’app mentionne macOS 10.15 et supérieur",[14,81,82],{},"Ouvre l’image disque et glisse SoundNinja dans Applications.",[31,84,86],{"id":85},"linux","Linux",[36,88,89,95,101,109],{},[39,90,91,94],{},[42,92,93],{},"Debian (.deb)"," pour Ubuntu \u002F Debian",[39,96,97,100],{},[42,98,99],{},"AppImage"," pour les autres distros",[39,102,103,104,108],{},"Après publication d’une release, les utilisateurs Arch peuvent installer ",[105,106,107],"code",{},"soundninja-bin"," depuis l’AUR",[39,110,111],{},"Testé sur Ubuntu 20.04",[14,113,114,115,118,119,122],{},"Les builds desktop ont besoin des paquets WebKit et GTK. Sous Debian\u002FUbuntu, ça veut souvent dire ",[105,116,117],{},"libwebkit2gtk",", ",[105,120,121],{},"libgtk-3-0"," et une bibliothèque app-indicator.",[31,124,126],{"id":125},"mises-à-jour","Mises à jour",[14,128,129,130,133],{},"Dans l’app, ouvre ",[42,131,132],{},"Aide → Rechercher les mises à jour",". Tu peux aussi laisser SoundNinja vérifier au démarrage dans les Paramètres.",[31,135,137],{"id":136},"compiler-depuis-les-sources","Compiler depuis les sources",[14,139,140,141,146,147,152],{},"Besoin d’un build custom ? Clone ",[18,142,145],{"href":143,"rel":144},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja",[27],"le repo",", installe les ",[18,148,151],{"href":149,"rel":150},"https:\u002F\u002Fv2.tauri.app\u002Fstart\u002Fprerequisites\u002F",[27],"prérequis Tauri",", puis :",[154,155,160],"pre",{"className":156,"code":157,"language":158,"meta":159,"style":159},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","bun install\nbun run tauri:serve\n","bash","",[105,161,162,175],{"__ignoreMap":159},[163,164,167,171],"span",{"class":165,"line":166},"line",1,[163,168,170],{"class":169},"sScJk","bun",[163,172,174],{"class":173},"sZZnC"," install\n",[163,176,178,180,183],{"class":165,"line":177},2,[163,179,170],{"class":169},[163,181,182],{"class":173}," run",[163,184,185],{"class":173}," tauri:serve\n",[14,187,188,118,191,45,194,197,198,201],{},[105,189,190],{},"npm",[105,192,193],{},"pnpm",[105,195,196],{},"deno"," marchent aussi. Build de production : ",[105,199,200],{},"bun run tauri:build",".",[14,203,204,207,208,213,214,217,218,201],{},[42,205,206],{},"Windows uniquement :"," chaque compile Windows inclut ASIO via le ",[18,209,212],{"href":210,"rel":211},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.steinberg.net\u002Fasiosdk",[27],"Steinberg ASIO SDK",". Lance ",[105,215,216],{},"bun run setup:asio"," une fois (SDK pas dans git). Linux et macOS utilisent PipeWire \u002F Core Audio — ignore cette étape. Détails : ",[18,219,222],{"href":220,"rel":221},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fblob\u002Fmain\u002Fdocs\u002Fbuild-from-source.md",[27],"build-from-source.md",[224,225,226],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sScJk, html code.shiki .sScJk{--shiki-default:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0}html pre.shiki code .sZZnC, html code.shiki .sZZnC{--shiki-default:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}",{"title":159,"searchDepth":177,"depth":177,"links":228},[229,230,231,232,233],{"id":33,"depth":177,"text":34},{"id":64,"depth":177,"text":65},{"id":85,"depth":177,"text":86},{"id":125,"depth":177,"text":126},{"id":136,"depth":177,"text":137},"Installe SoundNinja sur Windows, macOS ou Linux.","md",{},true,"\u002Finstallation",{"title":5,"description":234},"FOJJDNBAT_xV14QaxG490DTpeNiFpVDRFz_XEdyJKJE",[242,370,505,653,1056,1192,1339,1561],{"id":243,"title":244,"body":245,"description":364,"extension":235,"meta":365,"navigation":237,"order":166,"path":366,"seo":367,"stem":368,"__hash__":369},"content_fr\u002Foverview.md","Aperçu",{"type":7,"value":246,"toc":358},[247,250,253,256,259,263,277,281,320,324,333,337],[10,248,244],{"id":249},"aperçu",[14,251,252],{},"SoundNinja est un soundboard open source pour le live streaming, les discussions entre amis et l’enregistrement de podcasts. Il est construit avec Tauri v2 et Nuxt 4 pour rester léger en RAM et sur le disque.",[14,254,255],{},"Le but est simple : garder une énorme bibliothèque de sons facile à parcourir, puis jouer le bon clip en quelques millisecondes. L’interface marche aussi comme tableau de bord en VR.",[14,257,258],{},"SoundNinja est encore en développement précoce. Les fonctions marchent, mais toutes les plateformes ne sont pas entièrement testées.",[31,260,262],{"id":261},"pour-qui","Pour qui",[36,264,265,268,271,274],{},[39,266,267],{},"Les streameurs qui ont besoin de cues sonores instantanés",[39,269,270],{},"Les amis qui veulent un board partagé pour le vocal",[39,272,273],{},"Les podcasteurs qui enregistrent des clips et les posent sur un board",[39,275,276],{},"Quiconque veut un soundboard personnalisable et local-first",[31,278,280],{"id":279},"ce-que-tu-peux-faire","Ce que tu peux faire",[36,282,283,286,289,292,295,298,301,304,307,314,317],{},[39,284,285],{},"Construire un soundboard à partir de tes propres fichiers audio",[39,287,288],{},"Organiser les sons dans des onglets colorés, des groupes, des tags et la recherche",[39,290,291],{},"Filtrer par tags (OU) et trier par nom, date, durée ou taille",[39,293,294],{},"Sélection multiple avec rectangle ou plage Maj, puis couleur, déplacement ou suppression en lot",[39,296,297],{},"Régler le volume par son depuis le menu contextuel",[39,299,300],{},"Concevoir le look avec le Theme Creator",[39,302,303],{},"Enregistrer l’audio du PC ou un micro dans le Record Editor",[39,305,306],{},"Assigner des raccourcis à des sons individuels",[39,308,309,310],{},"Déclencher des sons depuis ",[18,311,313],{"href":312},"\u002Fdocs\u002Fremote-control","Bitfocus Companion",[39,315,316],{},"Importer et exporter un soundboard complet pour le partager",[39,318,319],{},"Utiliser des GIF ou des images sur les boutons — bibliothèque de dossiers locale ou KLIPY",[31,321,323],{"id":322},"licence","Licence",[14,325,326,327,332],{},"SoundNinja est un logiciel libre sous ",[18,328,331],{"href":329,"rel":330},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fblob\u002Fmain\u002FLICENSE",[27],"GPL-3.0",". Forke-le, modifie-le, partage-le.",[31,334,336],{"id":335},"prochaines-étapes","Prochaines étapes",[338,339,340,346,352],"ol",{},[39,341,342],{},[18,343,345],{"href":344},"\u002Fdocs\u002Finstallation","Installer SoundNinja",[39,347,348],{},[18,349,351],{"href":350},"\u002Fdocs\u002Fadding-sounds","Ajouter des sons",[39,353,354],{},[18,355,357],{"href":356},"\u002Fdocs\u002Forganizing-sounds","Organiser ton board",{"title":159,"searchDepth":177,"depth":177,"links":359},[360,361,362,363],{"id":261,"depth":177,"text":262},{"id":279,"depth":177,"text":280},{"id":322,"depth":177,"text":323},{"id":335,"depth":177,"text":336},"Ce qu’est SoundNinja et ce que tu peux en faire.",{},"\u002Foverview",{"title":244,"description":364},"overview","nBakDXsUbMnm0zyn8m6jAooziqocGWiZV3EwAtrg0xk",{"id":4,"title":5,"body":371,"description":234,"extension":235,"meta":503,"navigation":237,"order":177,"path":238,"seo":504,"stem":12,"__hash__":240},{"type":7,"value":372,"toc":496},[373,375,382,384,398,400,402,412,414,416,432,438,440,444,446,454,472,482,494],[10,374,5],{"id":12},[14,376,16,377,22,379,29],{},[18,378,21],{"href":20},[18,380,28],{"href":25,"rel":381},[27],[31,383,34],{"id":33},[36,385,386,392,394,396],{},[39,387,388,45,390,49],{},[42,389,44],{},[42,391,48],{},[39,393,52],{},[39,395,55],{},[39,397,58],{},[14,399,61],{},[31,401,65],{"id":64},[36,403,404,408,410],{},[39,405,406,73],{},[42,407,72],{},[39,409,76],{},[39,411,79],{},[14,413,82],{},[31,415,86],{"id":85},[36,417,418,422,426,430],{},[39,419,420,94],{},[42,421,93],{},[39,423,424,100],{},[42,425,99],{},[39,427,103,428,108],{},[105,429,107],{},[39,431,111],{},[14,433,114,434,118,436,122],{},[105,435,117],{},[105,437,121],{},[31,439,126],{"id":125},[14,441,129,442,133],{},[42,443,132],{},[31,445,137],{"id":136},[14,447,140,448,146,451,152],{},[18,449,145],{"href":143,"rel":450},[27],[18,452,151],{"href":149,"rel":453},[27],[154,455,456],{"className":156,"code":157,"language":158,"meta":159,"style":159},[105,457,458,464],{"__ignoreMap":159},[163,459,460,462],{"class":165,"line":166},[163,461,170],{"class":169},[163,463,174],{"class":173},[163,465,466,468,470],{"class":165,"line":177},[163,467,170],{"class":169},[163,469,182],{"class":173},[163,471,185],{"class":173},[14,473,474,118,476,45,478,197,480,201],{},[105,475,190],{},[105,477,193],{},[105,479,196],{},[105,481,200],{},[14,483,484,207,486,213,489,217,491,201],{},[42,485,206],{},[18,487,212],{"href":210,"rel":488},[27],[105,490,216],{},[18,492,222],{"href":220,"rel":493},[27],[224,495,226],{},{"title":159,"searchDepth":177,"depth":177,"links":497},[498,499,500,501,502],{"id":33,"depth":177,"text":34},{"id":64,"depth":177,"text":65},{"id":85,"depth":177,"text":86},{"id":125,"depth":177,"text":126},{"id":136,"depth":177,"text":137},{},{"title":5,"description":234},{"id":506,"title":351,"body":507,"description":646,"extension":235,"meta":647,"navigation":237,"order":648,"path":649,"seo":650,"stem":651,"__hash__":652},"content_fr\u002Fadding-sounds.md",{"type":7,"value":508,"toc":638},[509,512,515,519,538,542,573,577,596,600,614,617,621,628,632],[10,510,351],{"id":511},"ajouter-des-sons",[14,513,514],{},"Un board reste vide tant que tu n’ajoutes pas de clips. SoundNinja peut importer des fichiers, des dossiers entiers, un enregistrement ou un pack de soundboard partagé.",[31,516,518],{"id":517},"importer-des-fichiers-audio","Importer des fichiers audio",[338,520,521,532,535],{},[39,522,523,524,527,528,531],{},"Ouvre ",[42,525,526],{},"Fichier → Importer des fichiers audio",", ou utilise ",[42,529,530],{},"Importer"," dans la barre de navigation.",[39,533,534],{},"Choisis un ou plusieurs fichiers audio.",[39,536,537],{},"Les sons arrivent dans l’onglet actuel.",[31,539,541],{"id":540},"importer-des-dossiers","Importer des dossiers",[338,543,544,553,556],{},[39,545,523,546,549,550,552],{},[42,547,548],{},"Fichier → Importer des dossiers"," (ou ",[42,551,541],{}," dans la barre de navigation).",[39,554,555],{},"Ajoute un ou plusieurs dossiers. Glisse pour les réordonner avant l’import.",[39,557,558,559],{},"Choisis comment ils arrivent :\n",[36,560,561,567],{},[39,562,563,566],{},[42,564,565],{},"Importer comme onglets"," — chaque dossier devient son propre onglet",[39,568,569,572],{},[42,570,571],{},"Importer dans l’onglet actuel"," — chaque fichier va dans l’onglet actif",[31,574,576],{"id":575},"enregistrer-un-clip","Enregistrer un clip",[14,578,579,580,584,585,588,589,45,592,595],{},"Ouvre le ",[18,581,583],{"href":582},"\u002Fdocs\u002Frecording-editor","Record Editor"," depuis le bouton ",[42,586,587],{},"Enregistrer"," dans la barre du lecteur. Capture, coupe, puis ",[42,590,591],{},"Importer la sélection",[42,593,594],{},"Tout importer"," dans l’onglet actuel ou un onglet que tu choisis.",[31,597,599],{"id":598},"importer-un-soundboard","Importer un soundboard",[14,601,602,605,606,609,610,613],{},[42,603,604],{},"Fichier → Importer un soundboard"," charge un pack partagé. Les packs sont un ",[105,607,608],{},".zip"," qui contient ",[105,611,612],{},"project.sninja"," plus les fichiers audio. Après l’import, ouvre le projet et joue.",[14,615,616],{},"Tu peux aussi garder plusieurs projets (profils). Utilise le sélecteur de projet pour changer de board.",[31,618,620],{"id":619},"relier-les-fichiers-manquants","Relier les fichiers manquants",[14,622,623,624,627],{},"Si des fichiers audio bougent sur le disque, SoundNinja affiche ",[42,625,626],{},"Fichiers audio manquants",". Choisis un dossier à parcourir et relie les clips.",[31,629,631],{"id":630},"suite","Suite",[14,633,634,635,201],{},"Organise onglets, tags, filtres et raccourcis dans ",[18,636,637],{"href":356},"Organiser les sons",{"title":159,"searchDepth":177,"depth":177,"links":639},[640,641,642,643,644,645],{"id":517,"depth":177,"text":518},{"id":540,"depth":177,"text":541},{"id":575,"depth":177,"text":576},{"id":598,"depth":177,"text":599},{"id":619,"depth":177,"text":620},{"id":630,"depth":177,"text":631},"Importe de l’audio, des dossiers, des enregistrements et des soundboards partagés.",{},3,"\u002Fadding-sounds",{"title":351,"description":646},"adding-sounds","4l04_lLfE4dqOPh8H0Rav69GnvCVi_PKTEgAepysTeI",{"id":654,"title":637,"body":655,"description":1049,"extension":235,"meta":1050,"navigation":237,"order":1051,"path":1052,"seo":1053,"stem":1054,"__hash__":1055},"content_fr\u002Forganizing-sounds.md",{"type":7,"value":656,"toc":1034},[657,660,667,671,698,705,709,712,726,733,739,743,753,758,790,794,800,804,837,843,847,850,876,879,883,896,900,906,927,943,950,954,965,968,972,979,989,995,999,1007,1014,1031],[10,658,637],{"id":659},"organiser-les-sons",[14,661,662,663,666],{},"SoundNinja est conçu pour les grandes bibliothèques. ",[42,664,665],{},"Tags et filtres",", onglets, recherche, sélection multiple et raccourcis — le clip dont tu as besoin est à un clic (ou une touche) près.",[31,668,670],{"id":669},"onglets","Onglets",[36,672,673,680,687],{},[39,674,675,676,679],{},"Ajoute un onglet avec ",[42,677,678],{},"Ajouter un onglet",". Donne-lui une couleur pour scanner la barre vite.",[39,681,682,683,686],{},"La vue ",[42,684,685],{},"Tous"," montre chaque son à travers les onglets.",[39,688,689,690,693,694,697],{},"Un son peut appartenir à ",[42,691,692],{},"un ou plusieurs onglets",". Clic droit sur un son et utilise ",[42,695,696],{},"Déplacer vers l’onglet"," pour l’assigner.",[14,699,700,701,704],{},"Les transitions d’onglets sont dans ",[42,702,703],{},"Paramètres → Général"," : Slide, Fade, Boutons un par un, ou Aucune.",[31,706,708],{"id":707},"groupes","Groupes",[14,710,711],{},"Depuis la v0.5.3, les séparateurs peuvent devenir des groupes nommés :",[36,713,714,717,720,723],{},[39,715,716],{},"Ajouter, renommer ou supprimer un groupe depuis le menu contextuel",[39,718,719],{},"Glisser l’en-tête du groupe — les enfants suivent",[39,721,722],{},"Déposer des sons dans un groupe ou les en sortir",[39,724,725],{},"Régler la couleur de bordure, la couleur du nom et l’alignement des boutons (ou utiliser le défaut de l’onglet)",[14,727,728,729,732],{},"Tu peux toujours ajouter un ",[42,730,731],{},"Séparateur"," simple si tu as seulement besoin d’une coupure visuelle.",[14,734,735,736,201],{},"Clic droit sur l’espace vide du board pour ",[42,737,738],{},"Ajouter un groupe",[31,740,742],{"id":741},"tags-filtres","Tags \u002F Filtres",[14,744,745,746,749,750,752],{},"Les tags traversent les onglets. Le panneau ",[42,747,748],{},"Filtre"," (barre latérale ",[42,751,748],{},") sert à les créer et à filtrer le board.",[754,755,757],"h3",{"id":756},"créer-et-modifier-des-tags","Créer et modifier des tags",[338,759,760,765,776,783],{},[39,761,523,762,764],{},[42,763,748],{}," dans la barre latérale.",[39,766,767,768,771,772,775],{},"Sous ",[42,769,770],{},"Tags",", utilise ",[42,773,774],{},"Ajouter un tag"," — nom et couleur.",[39,777,778,779,782],{},"Renomme, recolore ou ",[42,780,781],{},"Supprimer le tag"," dans la même liste.",[39,784,785,786,789],{},"Si tu vois ",[42,787,788],{},"Aucun tag pour l’instant",", crée-en un ici avant d’assigner.",[754,791,793],{"id":792},"assigner-des-tags-aux-sons","Assigner des tags aux sons",[14,795,796,797,799],{},"Clic droit sur un son → ",[42,798,770],{}," (cases à cocher). Un son peut avoir plusieurs tags. S’il n’y en a encore aucun, le menu pointe vers le panneau filtre.",[754,801,803],{"id":802},"filtrer-le-board","Filtrer le board",[36,805,806,812,823,834],{},[