.",[39,1281,1282,45,1284,595],{},[42,1283,591],{},[42,1285,594],{},[31,1287,1289],{"id":1288},"séparation-de-stems-optionnel","Séparation de stems (optionnel)",[14,1291,1292,1293,1296,1297,1300,1301,1304],{},"Les builds officiels Windows, macOS et Linux livrent la fonction ",[42,1294,1295],{},"stems",". Le Record Editor peut garder les ",[42,1298,1299],{},"voix"," ou la ",[42,1302,1303],{},"musique"," avec BS-RoFormer.",[14,1306,1307,1308,1311,1312,1315],{},"Le modèle fait environ 158 MB et n’est ",[42,1309,1310],{},"pas"," inclus dans l’installateur. Télécharge-le depuis ",[42,1313,1314],{},"Paramètres → Séparation de stems",", ou accepte l’invite au premier lancement. L’installateur Windows peut aussi proposer de télécharger le modèle au premier démarrage.",[14,1317,1318,1319,1085,1322,1325],{},"Les builds source custom ont besoin d’un flag extra (",[105,1320,1321],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[105,1323,1324],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":159,"searchDepth":177,"depth":177,"links":1327},[1328,1329,1330,1331],{"id":1208,"depth":177,"text":1209},{"id":1241,"depth":177,"text":1242},{"id":1270,"depth":177,"text":1271},{"id":1288,"depth":177,"text":1289},"Capturer le micro ou l’audio du PC, éditer le clip et le poser sur ton board.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1194,"description":1332},"recording-editor","ZMpimB13mAmCTr4lHYb896wJ8oA5QijFuonM7e0rJU8",{"id":1340,"title":1341,"body":1342,"description":1554,"extension":235,"meta":1555,"navigation":237,"order":1556,"path":1557,"seo":1558,"stem":1559,"__hash__":1560},"content_fr\u002Fremote-control.md","Contrôle à distance",{"type":7,"value":1343,"toc":1547},[1344,1347,1350,1354,1383,1386,1389,1424,1428,1448,1451,1455,1487,1491,1497],[10,1345,1341],{"id":1346},"contrôle-à-distance",[14,1348,1349],{},"SoundNinja peut écouter sur ton réseau local pour que Bitfocus Companion (ou n’importe quel client HTTP\u002FWebSocket) joue et arrête des sons.",[31,1351,1353],{"id":1352},"activer-le-serveur-distant","Activer le serv